      "message": "Done in PS48. The create path now handles af_xdp_remove_program() failure separately: it sets args-\u003erv/args-\u003eerror, frees the partially allocated device directly, and skips the err2 rollback path that could retain an unregistered device. I also moved the if_nametoindex() failure path to the same direct partial-device cleanup so it does not call af_xdp_delete_if() with an invalid ifindex.",
